You let your mental forces go unchecked for an instant. All foes in a radius [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] are knocked 3 grids away from you.

Creatures that fail a mental save are also dazed for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns and take [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage.

If you do not have two mindstars equiped, but have them in your off set, you instantly automatically switch. The wild psionic powers are incompatible with the focused nature of psiblades.
